2190:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @note Macro IS_TIM_32B_COUNTER_INSTANCE(TIMx) can be used to check
2191:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   *       whether or not a timer instance supports a 32 bits counter.
