2247:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @brief  Force a continuous copy of the update interrupt flag (UIF) into the timer counter regis
2248:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @note This allows both the counter value and a potential roll-over condition signalled by the U
2249:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @rmtoll CR1          UIFREMAP      LL_TIM_EnableUIFRemap
2250:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @param  TIMx Timer instance
2251:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @retval None
