3658:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @note In 32-bit timer implementations returned captured value can be between 0x00000000 and 0xF
3659:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @note Macro IS_TIM_32B_COUNTER_INSTANCE(TIMx) can be used to check
3660:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   *       whether or not a timer instance supports a 32 bits counter.
