3771:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h **** /**
3772:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @brief  Set the clock source of the counter clock.
3773:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @note when selected clock source is external clock mode 1, the timer input
3774:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   *       the external clock is applied is selected by calling the @ref LL_TIM_SetTriggerInput()
3775:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   *       function. This timer input must be configured by calling
3776:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   *       the @ref LL_TIM_IC_Config() function.
3777:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @note Macro IS_TIM_CLOCKSOURCE_ETRMODE1_INSTANCE(TIMx) can be used to check
3778:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   *       whether or not a timer instance supports external clock mode1.
3779:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @note Macro IS_TIM_CLOCKSOURCE_ETRMODE2_INSTANCE(TIMx) can be used to check
3780:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   *       whether or not a timer instance supports external clock mode2.
3781:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @rmtoll SMCR         SMS           LL_TIM_SetClockSource\n
3782:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   *         SMCR         ECE           LL_TIM_SetClockSource
3783:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @param  TIMx Timer instance
3784:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @param  ClockSource This parameter can be one of the following values:
