4162:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   *       whether or not a timer instance supports the preload of SMS field in SMCR register.
4163:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @rmtoll SMCR         SMSPE           LL_TIM_IsEnabledSMSPreload
