  11:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c **** /**
  12:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c **** *   @file    pwm_common.c
  13:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c **** *   @version M4_VERSION
  14:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c **** *   @brief   This file provides firmware functions that implement the features
  15:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c **** *            of the PWM common component of the Stellar Motor Control.
  16:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c **** *
  17:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c **** *   @details This file provides firmware functions that implement the features
  18:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c **** *            of the PWM common component of the Stellar Motor Control.
  19:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c **** *
  20:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****  */
  21:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c **** 
  22:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c **** /* Includes ------------------------------------------------------------------*/
  23:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c **** #include "pwm_common.h"
  24:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c **** #include "clock.h"
  25:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c **** 
  26:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c **** /** @addtogroup STELLAR_PMSM_MC_FOC_LIBRARY
  27:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * @{
  28:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   */
  29:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c **** 
  30:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c **** /** @defgroup pwm_curr_fdbk PWM & Current Feedback
  31:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   *
  32:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * @brief PWM & Current Feedback components of the Stellar Motor Control
  33:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   *
  34:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * These components fulfill two functions in a Motor Control subsystem:
  35:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   *
  36:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * - The generation of the Space Vector Pulse Width Modulation on the motor's phases
  37:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * - The sampling of the actual motor's phases current
  38:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   *
  39:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * Both these features are closely related as the instants when the values of the phase currents
  40:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * should be sampled by the ADC channels are basically triggered by the timers used to generate
  41:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * the duty cycles for the PWM.
  42:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   *
  43:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * Several implementation of PWM and Current Feedback components are provided by the Motor Control
  44:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * SDK to account for the specificities of the application:
  45:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   *
  46:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * - The selected MCU: the number of ADCs available on a given MCU, the presence of internal
  47:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * compoarators or OpAmps, for instance, lead to different implementation of this feature
  48:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * - The Current sensing topology also has an impact on the firmware: implementations are provided
  49:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * for Insulated Current Sensors, Single Shunt and Three Shunt resistors current sensing topologie
  50:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   *
  51:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * The choice of the implementation mostly depend on these two factors and is performed by the
  52:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * Motor Control Workbench tool.
  53:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   *
  54:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * All these implementations are built on a base PWM & Current Feedback component that they extend
  55:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * and that provides the functions and data that are common to all of them. This base component is
  56:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * never used directly as it does not provide a complete implementation of the features. Rather,
  57:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * its handle structure (PWMC_Handle) is reused by all the PWM & Current Feedback specific
  58:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * implementations and the functions it provides form the API of the PWM and Current feedback feat
  59:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * Calling them results in calling functions of the component that actually implement the feature.
  60:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * See PWMC_Handle for more details on this mechanism.
  61:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****   * @{
