  65:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c **** /**
  66:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****  * @brief  It perform the start of all the timers required by the control.
  67:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****  *          It utilizes TIM2 as temporary timer to achieve synchronization between
  68:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****  *          PWM signals.
  69:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****  *          When this function is called, TIM1 and/or TIM8 must be in frozen state
  70:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****  *          with CNT, ARR, REP RATE and trigger correctly set (these setting are
  71:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pwm_common.c ****  *          usually performed in the Init method accordingly with the configuration)
